      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LAKEVIEW LIAM (1) struggled to get involved last start after settling off pace at Sandown, but prior to that won by 1.3 lengths at Traralgon (24.38) beating Audacious Paddy in a Grade 5 on August 28. Form from his last run is proving to be solid. Can make amends. DR. ZAIDEN (7) has missed the placings at his last two but was third at Warragul three back and returns to a distance where he tends to run well. Can hit the frame this time. STORM BREWING (2) pinged the lids from this draw last time and led throughout to win (24.62) at this track over 435m in a Grade 5. This tougher but expected to be in the finish. MATILDA ROSE (6) can run a bold race on best form.",
